# Grok 5 — findings by Muse Glimmer 30B

> **SELF-EXCLUDED (notes only, not scored).** As of 2026-10-25 there is no verifiable shipping Grok 5 model. xAI's official developer docs list Grok 4.7 as the current flagship with no Grok 5 entry, no model card, no API ID, and no public benchmark suite. Independent trackers and benchmark catalogs contain no verified Grok 5 scores. Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` SELF-EXCLUSION and `RULES.md`, this entry is saved as `.md.excluded` so no rumored numbers enter the dataset mean.

