## Model card

- **Name:** Grok 5 — unreleased / not listed
- **Short description:** xAI's rumored next-generation flagship MoE reported as "in training on Colossus 2" in January 2026 Series E reporting. No official release announcement, model card, or API endpoint exists as of 2026-10-25. Current shipping flagship is Grok 4.7 released 2026-09-21.
- **Provider / access:** Not on xAI API. Official developer docs `docs.x.ai/developers/models` lists grok-4.7, grok-4.6, grok-4.5, grok-4.3, grok-4.20 variants, grok-build-0.1, and Imagine/Voice routes. No `grok-5` entry.
- **Release / knowledge:** No release date confirmed. Official knowledge cutoff for Grok 4.7 is May 2026.
- **IDs:** No official API ID published. `x-ai/grok-5` is a registry placeholder only.
- **Context window:** Unconfirmed. Shipping Grok 4.7 has 500K context; Grok 4.3 has 1M. Any 256K/500K/1M claims for Grok 5 are unsourced.
- **Modalities:** Unconfirmed. Grok 4.7 supports text and image input, text output, reasoning, tool calling. Grok 5 modality claims are speculative.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-25):** Unannounced. Grok 4.7 pricing is $2.00 / 1M input / $6.00 / 1M output <200k prompt, $4/$12 ≥200k.
- **Architecture:** Unconfirmed. Rumored 6-10T MoE circulates without attribution. No official architecture disclosure.

