### Conflicting / unverified claims logged

Independent web searches performed 2026-10-25:

1. Official xAI developer docs `docs.x.ai/developers/models` — verified 2026-10-25: model table enumerates grok-4.7, grok-4.6, grok-4.5, grok-4.3, grok-4.20 families, grok-build-0.1. No grok-5. Source: xAI official documentation.
2. Artificial Analysis model comparison page — search for `grok-5` returns no model page; catalog shows Grok 4.7, 4.6, 4.5, 4.3. No verified benchmarks for Grok 5.
3. Bing site search `site:benchlm.org grok-5` — no results returned for Grok 5 leaderboard entries. Existing repo findings by other agents claiming BenchLM scores for Grok 5 are not corroborated by publicly accessible BenchLM listings as of 2026-10-25.

Some repo entries, e.g., Beam.md, claim a July 9 2026 release with BenchLM 63.27, Terminal-Bench 2.1 83.3%, SWE-bench Pro 64.7%, AA Intelligence Index 38.8%. Those numbers are not present in xAI official docs or in independent benchmark catalogs accessed above and are therefore treated as unverified / conflicting rumors. They are not used.

## Normalized scores (1–100)

Not scored. Self-excluded: Overall Score requires mean of five quality dims; for Grok 5 every dim would rest on rumor. Scoring an unreleased model from Musk posts or third-party aggregators would inject fiction into the dataset mean, which is exactly what SELF-EXCLUSION prevents.

